-- The reactor contract (S10R, PLAN row S10R; survey section 7, Q-S10-8 (a), Q-S10-11 (a), Q-S10-12 (d),
-- Q-S11-2 (a), Q-S11-5 (c)). A kit file: the fill of an encrypted intent (fillCipher, fillAuth, fillOpen,
-- fillSettle) and cancel, with its own state. The window comes from the DAO (examples/daokit.lang): enact
-- pays the new window to this contract, and the entry transfer sets window when the caller is the DAO
-- address (a contract constant, the receiver address of test/evmchain.sh). The share keys k1 k2, the
-- Lagrange constants l1 l2 and the opening helpers are copies of examples/daokit.lang (O31).
state State := makeState (window : U256) (keys : Map U256 Flag) (fills : Map U256 U256) (addrs : Map U256 Addr)

-- window 6 (the init of the DAO).
def init : State := makeState 6u mapEmpty mapEmpty mapEmpty

-- The DAO address.
def dao : Addr := 0x0000000000000000000000007265636569766572

